1
00:00:00,697 --> 00:00:02,027
(Penny:)Okay, I'm done.

2
00:00:02,699 --> 00:00:06,329
(Penny:)- How did you guys finish so fast?
- I don't know, there were a lot of pictures.

3
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:09,736
(Bernadette:)And one page only had the word
"brakka-dooom!"

4
00:00:12,075 --> 00:00:14,505
(Penny:)Yeah, well, I have street smarts.

5
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:16,668
(Bernadette:)So, what'd you guys think?

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,840
- Well, there was a lot of action.
- Hmm.

7
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,420
(Amy:)And the story moved along
at a brisk pace.

8
00:00:22,619 --> 00:00:26,109
(Amy:)It was, overall,
what's the word I'm looking for?

9
00:00:26,356 --> 00:00:27,586
- Stupid?
- So stupid.

10
00:00:28,892 --> 00:00:31,022
(Penny:)I don't know how Leonard
can get so caught up.

11
00:00:31,227 --> 00:00:34,557
(Bernadette:)It's crazy. They spend hours arguing
about things that don't even exist.

12
00:00:34,731 --> 00:00:36,131
- What a waste of time.
- I know.

13
00:00:36,366 --> 00:00:38,596
(Penny:)A hammer so heavy
that no one else can pick it up?

14
00:00:41,404 --> 00:00:45,534
I don't think it's heavy, I think it's some
sort of magic so only Thor can lift it.

15
00:00:45,742 --> 00:00:47,942
(Penny:)That makes even less sense, I mean...

16
00:00:48,144 --> 00:00:51,414
(Amy:)No, no, no, it doesn't.

17
00:00:52,415 --> 00:00:55,505
(Amy:)Thor is a god. The hammer is his.
Only he can use it.

